      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i noticed u mentioned how rail is more efficient for the economy and better for the environment, but i'm curious about the pushback. some people in the suburbs/rural areas argue that highway expansion is actually the more vital investment for their economic survival and mobility. how would u address those specific concerns in the report?",
